SUMMARY:Swannanoa Small Business Crawl
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome check out the thriving metropolis o
 f Swannanoa! We will meet and start at Short Sleeves coffee\, then wander 
 down to Ovenbird Bakery and ending at Blunt Pretzels. All are welcome to e
 njoy some caffeination and random history facts 🤓\nParking can be found
  on the street or in the small lot by Short Sleeves or the larger parking 
 lot between Ovenbird and Blunt\, in front of the Baptist Church.
