SUMMARY:Asheville Community Band Concert
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nThe Asheville Community Band was organiz
 ed in October\, 1979 as a concert band for musicians of all ages and profe
 ssions. Now composed of over ninety musicians\, this wind band truly repre
 sents Western North Carolina with members representing six counties. The a
 ll-volunteer band ranges in age from high school to octogenarian.\n\nThe c
 oncert starts at 3:30pm.\n\nWhile there is no fee on here\, tickets are $1
 2 and can be purchased at the door.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-introverts/events/316241252
 /
