SUMMARY:Crafting & Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Introverts\nCome hangout and bring something to do.\
 nWrite\, craft\, knit\, or just come by for a chat.\n\nSouthern Streams Co
 ffeeHouse serves organic\, fair trade coffee and espresso and offer a vari
 ety of other delicious drinks. The food assortment consists of pastries ma
 de in-house\, along with breakfast and lunch items.\n\nLocated right along
 side the Ecusta Trail in Laurel Park\, NC if anyone would like to take a s
 troll or bike ride before/after.
